{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qkQOvHPYXs1795710257.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克及太空探索技術公司SpaceX，向每名美國兒童贈送兩股股份。</p><p></p><p>馬斯克在社交平台發文，所贈送的兩股SpaceX股票，一股來自公司，一股來自他本人。股份預計在下個月轉讓，至於來自他本人的股份則受制於1年上市禁售期，要在明年6月鎖定期屆滿後轉讓。推算股份價值逾180億美元，折合逾約1,400億港元。</p><p></p><p>根據美國人口普查局數據，美國有約7,200萬名18歲以下兒童。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.297715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:37:21.308687+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:57:39.177348+00:00","content_hash":"57d9cfe5a039237680147738c9340a603d79347ada697eac2f9e737f626cc87c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T17:04:24.297715+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}